# Security and Secrets

- Secrets live in `.env` (gitignored). Never commit `.env`, tokens, or MSAL cache.
- MSAL token cache: `~/.cache/email-assistant/msal_cache.json` (outside repo).
- `MSGRAPH_CLIENT_ID` in `.env` only; use `.env.example` for documentation.
- Scraped inbox catalogs in `data/catalog/` may contain PII — treat as sensitive.
- `config.json` may contain client names and 340B IDs — business-sensitive.
- Studio binds `127.0.0.1` by default; do not expose without auth review.
- MVP: `AUTO_SEND_MODE=off` — drafts only, no auto-send.
- Tests use synthetic fixtures only (`tests/fixtures/sample_emails.json`).
- Do not log full email bodies or OAuth tokens.
